    "Every AWS Budgets operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane does with",
    "it. The service is JSON 1.1 under the `budgets` credential scope with the",
    "`AWSBudgetServiceGateway` target prefix, and has no console action. A budget is",
    "keyed by name; a notification is keyed by its type, operator, threshold and",
    "threshold type; a subscriber is the notification's `(type, address)` pair."
